    <tei:body>
      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:elekha_adonai_shivvanu_uvabboqer">
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:elekha_adonai_shivvanu_uvabboqer/1"/>To You, Adonoy, we cry
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:elekha_adonai_shivvanu_uvabboqer/2"/>and in the morning, our prayers greet You.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:elekha_adonai_shivvanu_uvabboqer/3"/>To You we lift our eyes,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:elekha_adonai_shivvanu_uvabboqer/4"/>[You] Who resides in heaven.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:elekha_adonai_shivvanu_uvabboqer/5"/>We lift our hearts to our hands
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:elekha_adonai_shivvanu_uvabboqer/6"/>to the Almighty in heaven.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:elekha_adonai_shivvanu_uvabboqer/7"/>God, our King from of old
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:elekha_adonai_shivvanu_uvabboqer/8"/>Who does wonders in the midst of the earth.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:elekha_adonai_shivvanu_uvabboqer/9"/>You are our King, O God,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:elekha_adonai_shivvanu_uvabboqer/10"/>command the deliverance of Jacob.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:elekha_adonai_shivvanu_uvabboqer/11"/>Deliver, Adonoy, Your people,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:elekha_adonai_shivvanu_uvabboqer/12"/>the remnant of Israel.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:elekha_adonai_shivvanu_uvabboqer/13"/>Deliver us, God of our deliverance;
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:elekha_adonai_shivvanu_uvabboqer/14"/>gather us and save us from the nations,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:elekha_adonai_shivvanu_uvabboqer/15"/>to give thanks to Your holy Name,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:elekha_adonai_shivvanu_uvabboqer/16"/>to be extolled in Your praise.</tei:p>
